  "evidence_limits": [
    "HFSC inactive; its generated settings are static derivation, not a measured comparison.",
    "tc JSON bandwidth and threshold rates are bytes/second, converted by multiplying by eight.",
    "CAKE memory_used is buffer_max_used in reference Linux6.12: a high-water statistic, not present allocation.",
    "Counters and max_pkt_len are cumulative per qdisc lifetime, not deltas in a matched benchmark.",
    "Source kernel Linux6.12 is a reference, not proof of byte-identical vendor kernel.",
    "Current manuals may expose capabilities absent in the installed kernel/modules.",
    "16 physical FQ-CoDel memory ceilings do not mean 1 GiB is reserved or currently occupied.",
    "No benchmark proves the recommendations increase throughput or cure the periodic pauses."
  ]
}
